@host = http://localhost:3111
@oidc = http://localhost:8081

### GET_TOKEN — fetch a JWT from the mock OIDC server
# @name token
POST {{oidc}}/default/token HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=dev&client_secret=dev-secret

### ANONYMOUS — no JWT, RLS hides all rows
GET {{host}}/endpoint_participante_listagem HTTP/1.1

### AUTHENTICATED — JWT with unidades: cras_1, cras_2
GET {{host}}/endpoint_participante_listagem HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### PROTOCOLS — window table, authenticated
GET {{host}}/protocolo_estado_diario HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### FILTER_BY_UNIDADE — PostgREST column filter
GET {{host}}/protocolo_estado_diario?id_unidade=eq.cras_1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### SELECT_COLUMNS — pick specific columns
GET {{host}}/endpoint_participante_listagem?select=nome,cpf HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}

### ORDER — sort by column
GET {{host}}/protocolo_estado_diario?order=protocolo_data_referencia_particicao.desc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token.response.body.access_token}}
